        "TileImage": "$($repository fca26a47-3751-4d9a-9145-f5623d2fbc7e).Image",
        "Description": "47, a client has ask we perform a little task,\rThey wanted me to make sure though that it wasn’t too much to ask;\rI quickly reassured them, for you’re the best we’ve got,\rI told them how great you are, 47, and told them you’d give it a shot.\r\rAll you have to do is go out in the world and obtain,\rSome intel from the people who by your hands are soon to be slain;\rHopefully that should lead us down the correct path,\rTo find a valuable item and match evil with your wrath.",
